Network Traffic Analyzer

Project Overview

This project analyzes network traffic to identify unusual activity and possible security threats.

Features

- Analyzes sample network traffic data.
- Identifies suspicious ports and possible port scans.
- Supports offline packet analysis.
- Generates analysis results in JSON format.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Scapy
- CSV and JSON

Purpose

This project was developed as a cybersecurity project for CSE 7th Semester.

Disclaimer

This is an educational project. It does not guarantee detection of all attacks or malware.
